<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,839.6 bln Bfr to Oct.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,839.6 bln Bfr to Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-Oct   change in mth  change in 1996</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>     - Belgian francs     6,999.8   +25.0	     +294.5</p>
<p>     - foreign currencies   672.8    -8.9	     -126.1</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>     - Belgian francs     1,842.8   -14.7	     +185.5</p>
<p>     - foreign currencies   289.7    +1.6		 +4.3</p>
<p> Net debt		     9,839.6    -2.5	     +318.8</p>
<p> Net borrowing requirement	     -6.5	     +324.8</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
